    LLM: "As declarer, discard weak suits into the Dobb to create 'voids' for trumping.\n\nUse 'schinden' - defenders holding back high cards to win later tricks with established winners.\n\nRecognize a 'Fuchs' (fox) - a single card in a suit that can be played to trick opponents into believing you have more of that suit.",
